    'Tenable focuses on exposure management: vulnerabilities and misconfigurations across IT, cloud, identities and OT can be made visible and prioritised by risk. Its portfolio combines discovery, context and remediation workflows; the deployed modules determine actual coverage. Security teams should assess asset attribution, integrations, risk decisions and clear remediation ownership. Observed catalogue reports about AI agents and products are individual items and are not automatically validated by the product overview.',
