    'Ivalua provides a platform for procurement and supplier management. It connects sourcing, contracts and supplier-lifecycle processes with purchasing, invoices and spend analytics. Value depends on master data, approvals, ERP integration and supplier adoption. Buyers should distinguish processes that can be standardised from local or industry requirements needing adaptation. Trade articles observed in the catalogue are individual market evidence rather than a validated feature list.',
