    'Extreme Networks develops networking infrastructure for campuses, data centres and distributed sites. Switching, wireless and cloud-based network management are core elements, with automation and analytics supporting operations. Architecture depends on buildings, devices, coverage, security policies and existing network components. Buyers should assess migration, licensing, integrations and responsibility for monitoring and incident resolution. Catalogue items on individual customers or products require review separate from the official portfolio overview.',
