    'Databricks combines data processing, analytics and AI development on a data platform. Lakehouse architecture, data engineering, governance and model workflows are designed to connect teams across structured and unstructured data. Implementation depends on the cloud environment, data formats, permissions and existing pipelines. Buyers should examine compute cost, data quality, interface openness and responsibility for models and operations. Catalogue publications on use cases need separate validation.',
